This web app allows the format conversion and value parsing of a saved loudpseaker layout between different common spatialization tools, as well as with the EASE acoustic simulation software.

To use: 

1. Extract file in a folder.
2. From that folder, in the Terminal/Command line, type :
 python -m http.server

Plans are being made to get the app accessible as a web app here : https://spatparse.sat.qc.ca
But is already available here : https://ease-format-parser-b8ebcd.gitlab.io/